{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_58", "type": "agent_message", "text": "The filtered deck builder accepted the selected ordering criterion and built a temporary four-card deck from `deck:Spanish is:new`. I emptied and deleted that deck afterward; the home screen again shows Spanish with all four cards. The builder’s dropdown showed eleven ordering criteria, and the selection survived a rotate away and back. I’m now testing add-note dismissal and edits against the supplied notes."}}
